# 生产镜像只复制代码；不要把本机凭据、虚拟环境、前端依赖和运行数据送进构建上下文。
.env
.env.*
frontend/.env*
desktop/.env*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
backend/.venv/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
desktop/dist/
desktop/release/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
tests/
eval/
dist/
var/
logs/
runtime-data/
backup/
secrets.enc.env
*.key
*.pem
*.log
*.tar
